    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memory",
      "description": "Resident set size against V8 heap used and heap total. Heap used climbing towards heap total without falling back after garbage collection is the shape of a leak, and n8n will be killed by the container memory limit before it recovers. Large gaps between RSS and heap total are buffers holding workflow payloads.",
